<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Germany: The Next Big Thing in International Education</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Germany is not just a study destination, it’s a powerhouse of academic excellence and opportunity. With over 400,000 international students expected in the 2024/25 winter semester, the country continues to attract top talent from around the world (The PIE, 2025). But here’s what you really need to know:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The Blocked Account requirement has increased to €11,904, a key change for students planning their financials (Source: Expatrio)</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Students now have expanded work rights thanks to the Skilled Worker Immigration Act, allowing up to 20 hours per week (Source: Make it in Germany)</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Five German universities have secured spots in the QS Top 100, reaffirming Germany’s global academic prestige (Source: QS World University Rankings 2025)</span></li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-733-46" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><a href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/FN2RRBS?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=on-the-fly-q1-2025" target="_blank" style="display: block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/7frw8uqa1h/en_us/images/67e0de677f45e-1742790247.5213.png" alt="image" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </a></td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
