<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#DCEAF6" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Croatia – a new European destination for your students!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Discover <span style="color: #c2346b;">Algebra Bernays University</span>, a leading private higher education institution from Croatia offering modern study programmes in Computer Science, Economy, Arts and Social Sciences, at bachelor and master level. Your students can choose between some of the most sought-after and exciting study programmes like Software Engineering, Data Science, 3D Design Game Development, Digital Marketing, and many more. All study programmes require students to complete an internship ensuring they’re ready for the labour market once they complete their studies! Oh, did we mention Croatia is an affordable student destination compared to other European destinations?</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><br />Connect with this institution and make Croatia your students next live &amp; learn destination!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-733-46" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><a href="mailto:international-office@algebra.hr" target="_blank" style="display: block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/7frw8uqa1h/en_us/images/67e0dc7fcbd99-1742789759.835.jpg" alt="image" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </a></td> 
</tr> 
