<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Credila Partnership Event</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">The Flywire team in India recently hosted a joyous networking event in Mumbai to celebrate our valued partnership with <strong>Credila</strong>, India’s number one loan provider for international students. This special occasion brought together Flymates from across the globe, underscoring Flywire’s strong commitment to fostering meaningful collaborations. The Credila Partnership Event was a resounding success, highlighting the strength of our partnership and our shared dedication to supporting students in achieving their educational aspirations.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
