<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">Flywire x Uhomes: Strengthening Partnerships for Seamless Payments</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">In the first quarter of 2025, the Flywire China team visited Uhomes offices in China to conduct comprehensive training on our innovative payment solutions. The session provided their team with valuable insights and tools to confidently navigate the upcoming peak season. This visit reinforced our partnership, aligned our strategies, and deepened our shared commitment to excellence. A special thanks to<strong> Ding Ning, Vice President at Uhomes</strong> and the entire Uhomes team for their warm hospitality and trust in Flywire.</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-733-46" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="560" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/7frw8uqa1h/en_us/images/67e22af5bb96a-1742875381.7684.jpg" alt="image" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 560px; max-width: 100%;" /> </td> 
